ted-foreground">other</span></span></p><p class="m-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Grouped by tool name. At most: moves money, runs code or commands, deletes data, or sends messages for you.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-foreground/[0.035] p-5"><h2 class="m-0 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.07em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">What it costs</h2><span class="text-[26px] leading-none font-bold">Free</span><p class="m-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Odel charges nothing per call. The publisher may charge for its own service.</p></div></div></section><section id="tools" aria-labelledby="tools-title" class="flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h2 id="tools-title" class="m-0 text-lg font-semibold">Tools</h2><span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">13<!-- --> · grouped by tool name<!-- --> · checked 31 Oct 2026</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 max-h-80 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-[3px] bg-accent-5" aria-hidden="true"></span>Read<!-- --> · <!-- -->2<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground">Look things up</span></h3><ul class="m-0 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><li title="market_search" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">market_search</li><li title="x402_check" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">x402_check</li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-[3px] bg-accent-6" aria-hidden="true"></span>Act<!-- --> · <!-- -->6<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground">Change something</span></h3><ul class="m-0 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 xl