] text-foreground">fair_random</li></ul></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-20 bg-gradient-to-t from-card" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent">Show all 13 tools</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg>Check details live</button><a href="https://dev.odel.app/inspector?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmodelmarket.dev%2Fmcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent">Try it in the Inspector<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id="readme" aria-label="README" class="scroll-mt-28 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-card"><div class="relative flex items-center gap-3 border-b bg-background-dark/60 px-4 py-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" s