<p>🔄 Synced from the <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AI-Factory monorepo</a> (append-only history). <strong>Pull requests are welcome</strong> — merged PRs are imported back and re-synced here. <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Issues</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/pulls" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Pull requests</a></p>
