<blockquote>
<p>🌐 <strong>English</strong> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/README.ru.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Русский</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/README.es.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Español</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/README.fr.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Français</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/README.zh.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">中文</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/localization-glossary.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Glossary</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Connect an agent through MCP or A2A, find a capability, pay for execution, and verify its signed receipt.</strong></p>
<p>AIMarket Hub integrates MCP tool calls and A2A agent requests with federated discovery, payment controls, and signed receipts. Oracle capabilities use the same marketplace. Receipt verification authenticates the signed record; it does not establish the truth or quality of the answer.</p>




















<div class="w-full overflow-x-auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Start here</th><th>Connect</th><th>First call</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MCP client</td><td><code>https://modelmarket.dev/mcp</code></td><td><code>market_search</code> → <code>market_invoke</code>, preserving <code>source_hub</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>A2A agent</td><td><code>/.well-known/agent-card.json</code> → <code>/a2a</code></td><td>Search → invoke with a price cap → inspect the Task → verify the receipt.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p><strong><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/agent-first-call.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Step-by-step guide and runnable example</a></strong></p>
<p>Both routes use the hub’s invoke and payment controls. Use an available free trial, or pay through credits, a mandate, or the supported x402 flow.</p>
<!-- -->
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Agents can already pay each other. We make it possible for them to trust each other.</strong></p>
<p>⚠️ <strong>Pay-on-Verified — read before relying on it.</strong> A buyer can make payment conditional on an independent verdict: the hub holds the price and pays the seller only if the delivery passes; a failing delivery is refunded. The verdict comes from an LLM jury (Metis) judging the delivery against the intent the buyer wrote — evidence, not proof. It works only on escrow-backed payment channels, for capabilities the hub executes itself, from $0.05.
→ <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/pay-on-verified-enable.md#disclaimer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">What it does not promise</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/pay-on-verified-enable.md#enable" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">How to enable it</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/pay-on-verified-demo.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">A run on real money</a></p>
</blockquote>
<!-- -->
<blockquote>
<h3 id="user-content--just-want-to-try-the-marketplace-install-nothing">🟢 Just want to try the marketplace? Install nothing.<a href="#user-content--just-want-to-try-the-marketplace-install-nothing" class="markdown-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Paste <strong><code>https://modelmarket.dev/mcp</code></strong> into Cursor, Claude, or any Streamable-HTTP MCP client.
Start with two tools, <strong><code>market_search</code></strong> + <strong><code>market_invoke</code></strong> (the endpoint&#x27;s <code>tools/list</code> has more: status, receipts, channels). A few trial invokes per caller, then <strong>429 <code>trial_quota_exhausted</code></strong> until the window renews; each invoke returns a signed receipt.
Pass <strong><code>source_hub</code></strong> from search back into invoke — most of the catalogue is federated, and omitting it 404s.
Live trial size: <code>free_trial.max_invokes_per_visitor</code> in <a href="https://modelmarket.dev/.well-known/ai-market.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">/.well-known/ai-market.json</a>.
→ <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/hosted-mcp-endpoint.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><code>docs/hosted-mcp-endpoint.md</code></a></p>
</blockquote>
<div class="markdown-code"><div class="markdown-code-head"><span>json</span><button type="button" class="markdown-copy" aria-label="Copy code"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><pre><code class="hljs language-json"><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;mcpServers&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;aimarket&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;streamable-http&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">,</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">&quot;url&quot;</span><span class="hljs-punctuation">:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://modelmarket.dev/mcp&quot;</span>
    <span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span>
  <span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span>
<span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span>
</code></pre></div>
<p>Cursor: <code>.cursor/mcp.json</code>. Claude Desktop: <code>claude_desktop_config.json</code>. Same shape. Agent skill (no clone): <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/agent-install/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><code>docs/agent-install</code></a>.</p>
<blockquote>
<h3 id="user-content--run-your-own-hub">🛠 Run your own hub<a href="#user-content--run-your-own-hub" class="markdown-anchor" aria-label="Link to this section"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a></h3>
<div class="markdown-code"><div class="markdown-code-head"><span>bash</span><button type="button" class="markdown-copy" aria-label="Copy code"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><pre><code class="hljs language-bash">pip install <span class="hljs-string">&quot;aimarket-hub[pqc]&quot;</span>     <span class="hljs-comment"># Python 3.11+, or: uvx --from &quot;aimarket-hub[pqc]&quot; aimarket …</span>
aimarket quickstart --name <span class="hljs-string">&quot;My hub&quot;</span> &amp;&amp; aimarket serve
</code></pre></div>
<p>Then <code>aimarket add</code> lists your own API (buyers pay your wallet directly), <code>aimarket doctor</code> runs the
admission check other hubs will run on you, and one <code>curl</code> knocks on the federation. Docker:
<code>docker compose run --rm hub quickstart</code> then <code>docker compose up -d</code>; Railway, Render and Fly files are included.
Paid computation through an oracle: <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/oracle-paid-tier.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">configure per-oracle paid-tier credentials</a>.
→ <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/operator-quickstart.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Run your own hub</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/run-on-a-platform.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">on a platform</a>
Already run an API? <code>aimarket node</code> makes it a node without a hub → <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/run-a-node.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">run a node</a>.
No server at all? Sell a Python function on HESTIA → <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/hestia/blob/main/docs/sell-without-a-server.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">sell without a server</a>.</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Ecosystem:</strong> <a href="https://ecosystem.modelmarket.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AICOM overview &amp; live demos</a> · <strong>Package:</strong> <a href="https://pypi.org/project/aimarket-hub/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">aimarket-hub on PyPI</a> · <strong>Community:</strong> <a href="https://discord.gg/JjWxGhW9pP" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Discord · Pollux</a> · <a href="https://t.me/just_for_agents" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Telegram · Castor</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p><strong>Federation hub for AI capability discovery, micropayment routing, and plugin-extensible invoke.</strong></p>
<p>Reference implementation of <a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-protocol/blob/main/spec.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AIMarket Protocol v2</a>. One HTTP surface to <strong>search</strong> a federated catalog, <strong>open payment channels</strong>, <strong>invoke</strong> capabilities with safety and compliance hooks, and <strong>settle</strong> on-chain — with custody depending on the selected payment rail.</p>









































<div class="w-full overflow-x-auto"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Live hub</strong></td><td><a href="https://modelmarket.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">modelmarket.dev</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>MCP</strong></td><td><a href="https://modelmarket.dev/mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><code>https://modelmarket.dev/mcp</code></a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>A2A</strong></td><td><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/a2a.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Agent Card and A2A guide</a> · <a href="https://modelmarket.dev/.well-known/agent-card.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Agent Card</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Agent skill</strong></td><td><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aicom/blob/main/docs/agent-install/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">docs/agent-install</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Well-known</strong></td><td><a href="https://modelmarket.dev/.well-known/ai-market.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">/.well-known/ai-market.json</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plugin demo</strong></td><td><a href="https://modelmarket.dev/plugins/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">/plugins/demo</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Widget demo</strong></td><td><a href="https://modelmarket.dev/widget/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">/widget/demo</a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plain-language value</strong></td><td><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-hub/blob/main/docs/value.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">docs/value.md</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
